--- A call through a list of functions types each member as a call of it
--- would: the spec's own `ops = [double, square]` then `ops[0][3]` had left
--- the members typed by nothing, and was refused in both modes (Rosetta
--- Code, Call a function).
fn double[x]
    return x * 2

fn square[x]
    return x * x

ops = [double, square]
log[ops[0][3]]
for f in ops
    log[f[4]]
